[{"title":"射虎行","author":"管讷","text":"黄草玄冬多虎踞，青山白日少人行。\n君王勃起英姿奋，卫士前驱猛气横。\n弓挽蛇皮如月满，箭飞雕羽若风生。\n弦开应手神应助，镞贯当心鬼亦惊。\n腥血溅时班尾折，伥魂落处锦毛倾。\n游兵警众铜龙吼，归队催程铁马鸣。\n一路尘埃天已冥，千营灯火夜初明。\n从今境内无惊扰，犬豕村村乐太平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"敬和画碧桃诗韵","author":"管讷","text":"风流画史惜年光，写出宫桃异众芳。\n深浅旧红浑改色，轻盈新碧倍生香。\n佳人金谷颜如雪，阿母瑶池鬓己霜。\n不与杏花争艳冶，肯随柳絮效颠狂。\n靓妆姑射花钿小，缓步飞琼玉佩长。\n勾引流莺窥翠幕，留连戏蝶绕华堂。\n题诗细咏情何极，呼酒相看醉不妨。\n带露一枝尤瑩洁，绝胜汤饼试何郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"脩竹芙蓉","author":"管讷","text":"水仙小队自成双，袅袅霓旌引翠幢。\n一夜湘君头尽白，西风离思满秋江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玄真诗意图","author":"管讷","text":"千峰云气涌如泉，远树微茫断复连。\n祗有大夫桥下路，青山都属钓鱼船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画扇","author":"管讷","text":"南州六月暍欲死，一见新图眼遽明。\n何处长林双树下，矮床茅屋听秋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秋江渔钓","author":"管讷","text":"蒹葭霜落水无埃，野艇维堤晚未开。\n为爱青山不归去，桥头遮莫大夫来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36001,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题倪元镇先生小景","author":"管讷","text":"泖上相逢记昔年，风姿晔晔似神仙。\n如今看画浑疑梦，春树云林一惘然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36002,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨桃花","author":"管讷","text":"武陵仙子绛绡裳，爱向春风试艳妆。\n一自别来颜色改，可堪憔悴见刘郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36003,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨竹","author":"管讷","text":"唤取官奴秉烛人，袜材休惜为传神。\n不知谁鼓湘灵瑟，千里秋风别恨新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36004,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题僧翠竹兰若","author":"管讷","text":"斗室秋阴不受尘，个中只许著閒人。\n欲知一体俱无象，莫认青青是法身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36005,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题中书舍人朱孟辩墨竹","author":"管讷","text":"楚楚郎官玉雪温，朝回缓步出金门。\n挥毫写得县崖竹，都是中天雨露痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36006,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍从如京道经庐州见桂花","author":"管讷","text":"山路秋花若个栽，天香远迓马头来。\n中官折入君王手，不负西风一度开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36007,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠洪山霖藏主","author":"管讷","text":"上人典藏东岩阁，阅尽西来贝叶书。\n秋水莲花千百亿，一莲花上一真如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36008,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送闻侍者游方","author":"管讷","text":"习得僧仪已绝群，龙门宗旨更多闻。\n飘然一锡诸方去，踏遍青山万里云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36009,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"参侍征南道中 其一","author":"管讷","text":"一溪水清石可数，千峰雨来云乱行。\n马蹄踏踏秋风里，无数好诗吟未成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36010,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"参侍征南道中 其二","author":"管讷","text":"竹寨驿前山水清，官船夜泊近行营。\n客程一月秋阴里，误听湍声作雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36011,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"参侍征南道中 其三","author":"管讷","text":"秋行一月多逢雨，路入南荒总是山。\n烟火人家何处觅，鹧鸪啼在石林间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36012,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书松雪翁墨迹后","author":"管讷","text":"吴兴翰墨人间少，白璧黄金价尽低。\n今日鸥波亭下路，王孙何处草萋萋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36013,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},